        "filing_date": "2026-03-10",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "As our lead product candidates advance through clinical development, we expect to enter into longer-term commercial supply agreements to fulfill and secure our production needs.",
        "start_character": 68628,
        "end_character": 68805
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-099360",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-099360-f34c6554e71915a4",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-099360",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-10",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "If we believe that partnerships can accelerate the development or maximize the market potential of our product candidates, we will consider entering into product, target and/or geographic specific strategic partnerships on an opportunistic basis.",
        "start_character": 19297,
        "end_character": 19543
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-099360",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-099360-f34c6554e71915a4",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-099360",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-10",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "If we need to change manufacturers during the clinical or development stage for product candidates or after commercialization for our product candidates, if approved, the FDA and corresponding foreign regulatory agencies must approve these new manufacturers in advance, which will involve testing and additional inspections to ensure compliance with FDA regulations and standards and may require significant lead times and delay.",
        "start_character": 69241,
        "end_character": 69670
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-099360",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-099360-f34c6554e71915a4",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-099360",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-10",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "If we succeed in developing and commercializing TARP8 products, Janssen will be eligible to receive (i) up to $76.0 million in development milestone payments and up to $40.0 million in sales milestone payments for the product containing the lead TARP8 development candidate, and (ii) up to $25.0 million in development milestone payments and up to $42.0 million sales milestone payments for other TARP8 products containing a non-lead TARP8 development candidate.",
        "start_character": 83329,
        "end_character": 83795
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-099360",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-099360-f34c6554e71915a4",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-099360",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-10",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In August 2022, we entered into a license agreement with Janssen (the “Janssen License”) for the research, development and commercialization of certain TARP8 products, including RAP-219, as well as nAChR projects created by Dr.",
        "start_character": 14695,
        "end_character": 14923
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-099360",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-099360-f34c6554e71915a4",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-099360",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-10",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Leveraging our expertise, we are developing a portfolio of precision product candidates that we believe has the potential to transform the standard of care of many neurological and psychiatric disorders.",
        "start_character": 978,
        "end_character": 1181
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-099360",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-099360-f34c6554e71915a4",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-099360",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-10",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "The key competitive factors affecting the success of RAP-219, and any other product candidates that we develop to address FOS and other neurological and psychiatric disorders, if approved, are likely to be efficacy, safety, convenience, price, the level of generic competition and the availability of reimbursement from government and other third-party payors.",
        "start_character": 71791,
        "end_character": 72151
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-099360",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-099360-f34c6554e71915a4",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-099360",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-10",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Using two distinct strategies, we are leveraging our expertise in RAP biology to develop a portfolio of precision neuroscience product candidates that we believe will transform the treatment of many neurological and psychiatric disorders.",
        "start_character": 20888,
        "end_character": 21126
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-099360",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-099360-f34c6554e71915a4",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-099360",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-10",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We are committed to leveraging our expertise in RAP biology to develop a portfolio of small molecule therapies to deliver potentially more effective, better tolerated and safer treatments to large and underserved neurological and psychiatric patient populations.",
        "start_character": 18865,
        "end_character": 19127
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-099360",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-099360-f34c6554e71915a4",
